    "detailed_description": "Astronimo is a construction platform puzzler that aims to be the most fun you can have in outer space.<br><br>While mining for minerals in the vast reaches of the galaxy, four Hypergiant Inc. employees crash-land on a small planet and become hopelessly stranded. <br><br>In the hopes of reuniting with their fleet, you must help them to cover every inch of the planetary surface, solve puzzles in unique and creative ways, and then build a shuttle and fuel it to launch back into space. <br><br>Astronimo lifts platforming and customisation to the interstellar medium and beyond with a quirky campaign and customisation tools that stretch the bounds of your imagination.<br><br><strong>Chart A Whole Galaxy </strong><br>A fun-filled campaign featuring the Turilla, Acara, Zaroth IV, and Nixnillon planets. As well as four mini-moons and discoveries aplenty!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/d0082e92d0f388b28082f593e4986a0a.poster.avif?t=1718023101\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/d0082e92d0f388b28082f593e4986a0a.webm?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/d0082e92d0f388b28082f593e4986a0a.mp4?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Endless Fun with Friends </strong><br>Play co-op with up to three others locally or online and work out how to get back home together with wacky builds, secrets to discover and planets to explore. <br><br>Wave. Play Music. Be a dog in space. Astronimo is all about having fun and sharing memories with friends, old and new.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/a3cd39fa623069b98eed10e82883b373.poster.avif?t=1718023101\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/a3cd39fa623069b98eed10e82883b373.webm?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/a3cd39fa623069b98eed10e82883b373.mp4?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Compose Cosmos </strong><br>The World Editor provides elaborate tools to build and populate your own planets to an incredible level of detail and share your creations through Steam Workshop. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/eb6cf8edd02d54ac8e11bc47ca99fec8.poster.avif?t=1718023101\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/eb6cf8edd02d54ac8e11bc47ca99fec8.webm?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/eb6cf8edd02d54ac8e11bc47ca99fec8.mp4?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Drag, Drop and Distribute </strong><br>Workshops make crafting the unimaginable easy. If you can think it, then with Astronimo \u2013 you can build it!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/54558a230e9b53a4544d44e8612e0858.poster.avif?t=1718023101\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/54558a230e9b53a4544d44e8612e0858.webm?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/54558a230e9b53a4544d44e8612e0858.mp4?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Astronimo is a construction platform puzzler that aims to be the most fun you can have in outer space.<br><br>While mining for minerals in the vast reaches of the galaxy, four Hypergiant Inc. employees crash-land on a small planet and become hopelessly stranded. <br><br>In the hopes of reuniting with their fleet, you must help them to cover every inch of the planetary surface, solve puzzles in unique and creative ways, and then build a shuttle and fuel it to launch back into space. <br><br>Astronimo lifts platforming and customisation to the interstellar medium and beyond with a quirky campaign and customisation tools that stretch the bounds of your imagination.<br><br><strong>Chart A Whole Galaxy </strong><br>A fun-filled campaign featuring the Turilla, Acara, Zaroth IV, and Nixnillon planets. As well as four mini-moons and discoveries aplenty!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/d0082e92d0f388b28082f593e4986a0a.poster.avif?t=1718023101\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/d0082e92d0f388b28082f593e4986a0a.webm?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/d0082e92d0f388b28082f593e4986a0a.mp4?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Endless Fun with Friends </strong><br>Play co-op with up to three others locally or online and work out how to get back home together with wacky builds, secrets to discover and planets to explore. <br><br>Wave. Play Music. Be a dog in space. Astronimo is all about having fun and sharing memories with friends, old and new.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/a3cd39fa623069b98eed10e82883b373.poster.avif?t=1718023101\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/a3cd39fa623069b98eed10e82883b373.webm?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/a3cd39fa623069b98eed10e82883b373.mp4?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Compose Cosmos </strong><br>The World Editor provides elaborate tools to build and populate your own planets to an incredible level of detail and share your creations through Steam Workshop. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/eb6cf8edd02d54ac8e11bc47ca99fec8.poster.avif?t=1718023101\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/eb6cf8edd02d54ac8e11bc47ca99fec8.webm?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/eb6cf8edd02d54ac8e11bc47ca99fec8.mp4?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Drag, Drop and Distribute </strong><br>Workshops make crafting the unimaginable easy. If you can think it, then with Astronimo \u2013 you can build it!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/54558a230e9b53a4544d44e8612e0858.poster.avif?t=1718023101\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/54558a230e9b53a4544d44e8612e0858.webm?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808640/extras/54558a230e9b53a4544d44e8612e0858.mp4?t=1718023101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
